What is it?
-----------

Lemonade Stand is a simple/fun arexx game for Amiga CNet/3 PRO.
It requires at least an 80 column screen and IBM/ANSI for play.

Installation:
-------------

1. Unarch the program :) Lets hope this part is already done.
2. Move the LEMON directory into your pfiles directory or whatever
   directory that you would like. Be sure to set the path option
   at the top of the main file should you not place it in pfiles.
3. Set the TREWARD option at the top of the main file for what ever
   amount of time that you would like to reward the top 10 with.
   The default is 15 minutes. 0 to disable  
4. Adopt the LEMONADE.REXX program as an arexx pfile.
5. Set to one user at a time.
6. Disable the More prompt.
7. Save

Thats it! Simple.

